[122.57361, "o", "  1147: Continued from Brief 07. Set `policy_waiver` when final status is `approved`,\r\n"]
[122.573628, "o", "  1148: `amount_usd` > 10000, and a Policy Exception block exists for that transaction\r\n"]
[122.573648, "o", "  1149: with `approved_by: compliance` on its own line. Set `retroactive_review` when\r\n"]
